In addition to the M5 chip, the &zwnj;MacBook Air&zwnj; now contains Apple's custom N1 wireless chip for Wi-Fi 7 and Bluetooth 6 connectivity. <br/>
<br/>
The &zwnj;MacBook Air&zwnj; now starts with 512GB of storage and continues to be configurable up to 4TB. The SSD also has 2x faster read and write performance compared to the previous generation. <br/>
